==Battleground==
*1 [[Duche]] spawns after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*2 [[Gudegude à la mode (Enemy)|Gudegude à la modes]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gude-Doge Machine]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Rain D.|Rain Ds]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Metal Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Gude-Doge Machine is buffed for 150%, but even then, he won't be too hard to take down. However, on 3-Crown difficulty, the stage begins to get difficult and its support gets more difficult to deal with as well. A strategy is to use Metal Hippoe to damage the Gude-Doge Machine and the Rain Ds. You can use [[Crazed Gross Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Macho Legs]] and [[Red Riding Mina (Special Cat)|Red Riding Mina]] to damage them with Metal Hippoe as a stepping stone. This works for other [[:Category:Wave Attack Cats|Wave Attackers]] and [[:Category:Long Distance Cats|Long-Distance Cats]].

